  Verification.combineLanes a (b + 4 * a) (a0 + x0) (a1 + x1) (a2 + x2) (a3 + x3) (b0 + a0 + x0) (b1 + a1 + x1)
      (b2 + a2 + x2) (b3 + a3 + x3) =
    List.foldl Verification.ringStep (Verification.combineLanes a b a0 a1 a2 a3 b0 b1 b2 b3) [x0, x1, x2, x3]
